@startuml CU-32
actor "Administrador" as Admin
boundary "«UI» Angular (Admin/Reportes)" as UI
control "«Controller» API /ai/reports" as Ctrl
entity "«Model» AIService / Ollama (codellama)" as Model
database "«DB» PostgreSQL" as DB

Admin -> UI : 1: Escribe prompt en lenguaje natural
UI -> Ctrl : 2: POST /api/v1/ai/reports/generate {prompt, max_rows}
Ctrl -> Model : 3: generate_sql_query(prompt, max_rows)
Model -> Model : 4: Construir prompt con esquema + reglas
Model -> Model : 5: Ollama.generate(codellama, prompt)
Model -> Model : 6: _extract_sql(response)
Model -> Model : 7: _validate_sql(sql, allowed_tables)
Model -> DB : 8: conn.execute(sql)
DB --> Model : 9: columns, rows
Model --> Ctrl : 10: {columns, rows, row_count, sql, exec_time}
Ctrl --> UI : 11: AIReportResponse
UI --> Admin : 12: Tabla de resultados + SQL generado (opcional)

@enduml